================================================================================
liblzf and h5py's LZF filter (ported)
================================================================================

Sources/FormatoHDF5/LZFFilter.swift ports liblzf 3.6's decoder (lzf_decompress in lzf_d.c, as h5py 3.16.0 vendors it under
lzf/lzf/) and follows h5py 3.16.0's LZF filter callback (lzf/lzf_filter.c): FormatoHDF5 registers it with libhdf5 as filter
32000, decode only, so datasets h5py or AZtec compressed with LZF read. tools/hdf5-lzf/generate.py writes the test file with
h5py's own LZF encoder.

